## Model card

- **Name:** Grok 4 Fast (Non-reasoning)
- **Short description:** SpaceXAI's September 2025 non-reasoning, cost-optimized variant of Grok 4; $0.20/$0.50 per 1M tokens with 2M context. Deprecated — SpaceXAI launched Grok 4.1 Fast as a newer release.
- **Provider / access:** SpaceXAI API; OpenCode Zen: not listed in Zen model table
- **Release / knowledge:** Released September 19, 2025; knowledge cutoff not published
- **IDs:** `opencode/grok-4-fast` (per `meta.json`); `grok-4-fast` (AA model page slug)
- **Context window:** 2M total (per AA model page; `meta.json` says 128K — discrepancy)
- **Modalities:** Text and image input, text output (per AA model page; `meta.json` says "Text in/out" — discrepancy)
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-01):** $0.20 input / $0.50 output per 1M tokens (per AA model page)
- **Reasoning:** No (non-reasoning variant; AA page describes "Non-reasoning model")
- **Status:** Deprecated (AA page notes SpaceXAI launched Grok 4.1 Fast as newer release)

